# Proposed by the swarm (2026-10-15); the documenter may edit or drop it.
# Story: a MacBook Air, Mail on the left, the chat on the right. 820 and 760 points do not both fit on 1440, so one of the two is a tile.
# Which? Never the one being typed in: ⌘Tab to the other, ⌃⌥Space, and the two have traded places.
# Reference: T20, F61 (second round, 3), rule 4.
open Mail 1100x700 min 820x400
open Slack 1100x750 min 760x500
focus 101
key ctrl+opt+left
focus 102
key ctrl+opt+right
expect visible 102
expect tile 101
# ⌘Tab to Mail frames it. Show Everything shows it beside the chat's tile.
focus 101
expect fills 101
key ctrl+opt+space
expect visible 101
expect focused 101
expect tile 102
# And back.
focus 102
key ctrl+opt+space
expect visible 102
expect focused 102
expect tile 101
expect size 102 760x851
